  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: block-level parallelism (single pack/extract fans 64 KiB blocks across workers, byte-identical), codec scratch pooling, hardened pool/error contracts, CLI positional guards (-o/--iso extras rejected like the oracle), CLI battle-test suite, XISOSharp via NuGet. See WhatsNew.md.",
